OL,3,GNEWSATask force aims to end rough
OL,4,Asleeping by Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FA task force has been set up to ensure
OL,7,Fall rough sleepers in a rural county
OL,8,Fhave a place to stay by Christmas.
OL,10,FAbout 25 people are currently known to
OL,11,Fbe living on the streets in the Dorset
OL,12,FCouncil area, with the highest numbers
OL,13,Fin Weymouth, Bridport and Lyme Regis.
OL,15,FDorset has been allocated #1.1m of
OL,16,Fgovernment funding as part of a #442m,
OL,17,FUK-wide package to provide those people
OL,18,Fwith a route off the streets.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
