OL,3,GNEWSATask force aims to end rough
OL,4,Asleeping by Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe task force involves housing,
OL,7,Fhealth, support services and voluntary
OL,8,Fsector organisations, who will assess
OL,9,Fneeds, coordinate referrals and
OL,10,Fidentify the most appropriate
OL,11,Faccommodation and support for each
OL,12,Fperson.
